    { Visibility=Private }
    Procedure RegisterComEvents
        Send RegisterComEvent 1 msg_OnComColumnClick
        Send RegisterComEvent 2 msg_OnComRowRClick
        Send RegisterComEvent 3 msg_OnComRowDblClick
        Send RegisterComEvent 4 msg_OnComSelectionChanged
        Send RegisterComEvent -602 msg_OnComKeyDown
        Send RegisterComEvent -604 msg_OnComKeyUp
        Send RegisterComEvent 5 msg_OnComItemCheck
        Send RegisterComEvent 6 msg_OnComBeforeDrawRow
        Send RegisterComEvent 107 msg_OnComColumnOrderChangedEx
        Send RegisterComEvent 8 msg_OnComSortOrderChanged
        Send RegisterComEvent 9 msg_OnComValueChanged
        Send RegisterComEvent 10 msg_OnComInplaceButtonDown
        Send RegisterComEvent -606 msg_OnComMouseMove
        Send RegisterComEvent -605 msg_OnComMouseDown
        Send RegisterComEvent -607 msg_OnComMouseUp
        Send RegisterComEvent 11 msg_OnComDrawItem
        Send RegisterComEvent 12 msg_OnComMeasureRow
        Send RegisterComEvent 13 msg_OnComRowExpanded
        Send RegisterComEvent 14 msg_OnComRequestEdit
        Send RegisterComEvent 15 msg_OnComBeforeCopyToText
        Send RegisterComEvent 16 msg_OnComBeforePasteFromText
        Send RegisterComEvent 17 msg_OnComBeforePaste
        Send RegisterComEvent 18 msg_OnComValueChanging
        Send RegisterComEvent 19 msg_OnComPreviewKeyDown
        Send RegisterComEvent 20 msg_OnComBeginDrag
        Send RegisterComEvent 22 msg_OnComEditCanceled
        Send RegisterComEvent 23 msg_OnComHyperlinkClick
        Send RegisterComEvent 24 msg_OnComDrawPreviewItem
